<title>USA: Axsys Tech to redeem preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Axsys Tech to redeem preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axsys Technologies Inc said Wednesday that it has called for redemption all remaining outstanding shares of its $1.20 Cumulative Exchangeable Redeemable Preferred STock for $7.70 a share, including accrued dividends of $1.54.</p>
<p>A total of 200,873 shares of preferred stock have been called for redemption.</p>
<p>The redemption date is June 4, 1997.</p>
